Modifications (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
------------------------------------------------
The file in this repository was changed from the original as follows:

  1. Converted from ONNX to TensorFlow Lite format using onnx2tf 1.28.8 with
     TensorFlow 2.19.0, using a fixed batch size of 1 (input [1,3],
     output [1,9789]). Weights are stored as float16.
  2. All 17 ONNX "Erf" operations (used in the GELU activations) were
     replaced, before conversion, with an equivalent approximation built from
     basic operators (Abramowitz and Stegun formula 7.1.26, using Abs, Sign,
     Mul, Add, Div, Neg, Exp and Sub), so that the TensorFlow Lite model uses
     built-in operators only. Constants for the approximation are stored in
     float16, matching the precision of the original Erf inputs.

Outputs therefore differ slightly from the original model; see README.md.

